            ],
            "Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.": [
                "Recenze ze slu\u017eby Trustpilot se stahuj\u00ed jednou denn\u011b na pozad\u00ed a ukl\u00e1daj\u00ed se na va\u0161em webu, tak\u017ee n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvnost str\u00e1nky nestoj\u00ed na va\u0161em \u00fa\u010dtu Trustpilot nic nav\u00edc; pokud se aktualizace nezda\u0159\u00ed, z\u016fstanou zachov\u00e1ny posledn\u00ed recenze. Google ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed sv\u00fdch recenz\u00ed nepovoluje, tak\u017ee se na\u010d\u00edtaj\u00ed \u017eiv\u011b, kdy\u017e n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk str\u00e1nku zobraz\u00ed: ka\u017ed\u00e9 zobrazen\u00ed p\u0159edstavuje jeden po\u017eadavek na v\u00e1\u0161 vlastn\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010d Google \u00fa\u010dtovan\u00fd spole\u010dnost\u00ed Google."
